# A distributed smart building network.
# Combines Mesh Routing and State Machines.

# Room A
make a neuron named room_a_light with threshold 1 and leak 0
make a router named hallway_router

# Room B
make a neuron named room_b_light with threshold 1 and leak 0

# External triggers
put motion_sensor_a into the input of room_a_light
put motion_sensor_b into the input of room_b_light

# The Mesh: If Room A's light turns on, route that spike through the hallway to Room B
route the spike from room_a_light through hallway_router to room_b_light

start the system
